Apply on urma_driver branch sp4_driver:
  cd urma_driver && git checkout sp4_driver && git apply urma_driver-sp4-gpu-legacy-matt.patch
Or pull the branch:
  git fetch origin cursor/udma-gpu-legacy-matt-5a36 && git checkout cursor/udma-gpu-legacy-matt-5a36
After this overlay is loaded, if write_lat_gpu still hits ummu event 0x0a /
URMA_CR_LOC_ACCESS_ERR (status 4), also apply urma_driver-sp4-gpu-sg-4k.patch
(64KB NVIDIA pages split to 4KB; UMMU pgsize_bitmap has no 64KB leaf).

